  "problem": "Consider the square $C$ in the plane with vertices $(0,0),(0,1),(1,0)$ and $(1,1),$ and the region $D$ bounded by $C.$ According to Green's theorem, \n\n$$\n{\u222e}_{C}{y}^{2}\\,dx+{x}^{2}\\,dy={\u222c}_{D}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}A,\n$$\n\nwhere $C$ is traversed counterclockwise. Calculate the function $f(x,y).$",
